# Copy to .env and fill in before launch.

# Where the enquiry form posts. Any service that accepts a normal form POST
# works: Formspree, Web3Forms, Netlify Forms, a Cloudflare Worker, your own
# handler. Must be PUBLIC_ prefixed — Astro only exposes those to the browser.
#
# Until this is set, the form validates and then shows the phone number and
# email address instead of pretending to send.
#
# Whichever provider you choose, name it in the "Who we share it with" section
# of src/pages/privacy.astro. It receives everything typed into the form.
PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=
